msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "演習の手順"

#: PART1.md:72
msgid ""
"In a new file `plumed_metad.dat`, declare the atom groups that will be used "
"in CVs. You will need one for the Mg<sup>2+</sup>, one for the free "
"phosphate oxygen atoms (O1P/O2P in the GRO file), and one for all the water "
"oxygen atoms (OW)."
msgstr ""

